── TWO-STYLE HELD BOOK (growth_score book + pure-earnings_yield book, equal-weight UNION, held 12y no-sell) ──
  growth top-10  [baseline]  book +8.8%/yr  excess +2.6  win 62%  worst -18.5  OOS +9.5/-4.3
  value  top-10              book +0.7%/yr  excess -10.9  win 12%  worst -18.5  OOS -7.4/-14.5
